  "title": "Taiwanese Fried Tofu",
  "description": "Firm tofu is seared, then simmered with Chinese black vinegar and soy sauce to create an authentic Taiwanese side dish my vegetarian mother prepares. Tastes great with rice and other vegetables. Note: This is not a saucy dish.",
